 "pedagogical_approach": "Collaborative writing-to-learn: groups first annotate each observation with the specific pressure principle that explains it, then compose a connected explanatory narrative that forces them to order and link those principles into a single causal chain — making the synthesis visible as a piece of reasoning, not a list."
